    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a charming pixel art world where managing your farm becomes a constantly evolving adventure. Start with limited resources and transform your land into a thriving agricultural enterprise through crops, livestock, and impressive constructions like windmills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the seasons change and the map expands, unlock new possibilities to upgrade and automate your activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484080/extras/c13b0fa842bec9fc7c08ce1493221e26.avif?t=1741363960\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building and management</strong>: Create your farm starting from crops, livestock, and advanced structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic progression</strong>: Unlock new areas and features as your farm grows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal variations</strong>: Adapt your strategies to the changing seasons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging interaction</strong>: Speed up production by clicking on constructions to gather resources faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and Automation</strong>: Make your operations more efficient with enhanced buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls</strong>: Move the camera with WASD and interact through point-and-click.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a charming pixel art world where managing your farm becomes a constantly evolving adventure. Start with limited resources and transform your land into a thriving agricultural enterprise through crops, livestock, and impressive constructions like windmills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the seasons change and the map expands, unlock new possibilities to upgrade and automate your activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484080/extras/c13b0fa842bec9fc7c08ce1493221e26.avif?t=1741363960\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building and management</strong>: Create your farm starting from crops, livestock, and advanced structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic progression</strong>: Unlock new areas and features as your farm grows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal variations</strong>: Adapt your strategies to the changing seasons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging interaction</strong>: Speed up production by clicking on constructions to gather resources faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and Automation</strong>: Make your operations more efficient with enhanced buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls</strong>: Move the camera with WASD and interact through point-and-click.</p></li></ul>",
